<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Portal Docente - SisInfo</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-blue-900 to-emerald-900 min-h-screen p-6 relative">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-8 border border-white/20">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
                <div class="bg-emerald-600 rounded-full p-3">
                    <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H9a4 4 0 00-4 4v2m8-10a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Portal Docente</h1>
                    <p class="text-emerald-200">Hola, Profesor <strong>{{username}}</strong></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">Bienvenido a tu portal docente.</p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
                <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 text-gray-400 cursor-not-allowed">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"/>
                        </svg>
                        <span class="font-semibold">Ver materias asignadas (Próximamente)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-5 text-gray-400 cursor-not-allowed">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/>
                        </svg>
                        <span class="font-semibold">Cargar notas (Próximamente)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center">
                <a href="/logout" class="inline-block bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white py-2 px-6 rounded-lg transition font-medium">
                    Cerrar Sesión
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fixed bottom-4 right-4 opacity-70 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
        <img src="/images/logo_unrc.png" alt="UNRC" class="w-16 h-16 drop-shadow-lg">
    </div>
</body>
</html>